WEBVTT

1
00:51:28.170 --> 00:51:31.170
Did anyone enjoy the worship?

2
00:51:33.170 --> 00:51:36.170
Did we do three or four songs?

3
00:51:36.170 --> 00:51:39.170
Four, right? Three? Yes, all right.

4
00:51:39.170 --> 00:51:41.170
Then just three.

5
00:51:41.170 --> 00:51:43.170
If you prefer that.

6
00:51:43.170 --> 00:51:45.170
Is everyone doing well?

7
00:51:46.170 --> 00:51:48.170
Two people. Nice.

8
00:51:48.170 --> 00:51:50.170
Great.

9
00:51:50.170 --> 00:51:52.170
That's just great.

10
00:51:52.170 --> 00:51:55.170
Hallelujah. Praise God.

11
00:51:55.170 --> 00:51:58.170
We have called Patrick and Hadassah to the stage.

12
00:51:58.170 --> 00:52:00.170
They have something to share.

13
00:52:02.170 --> 00:52:04.170
It's your last Sunday here, isn't it?

14
00:52:04.170 --> 00:52:06.170
Last Sunday. Everyone?

15
00:52:06.170 --> 00:52:08.170
Oh, go ahead.

16
00:52:08.170 --> 00:52:09.170
That's good.

17
00:52:09.170 --> 00:52:11.170
But you are leaving with joy.

18
00:52:11.170 --> 00:52:14.170
So Patrick, Hadassah, who shall I give the Word to?

19
00:52:20.170 --> 00:52:21.170
Hello.

20
00:52:22.170 --> 00:52:24.170
I want to share something with you.

21
00:52:24.170 --> 00:52:29.170
Something very special has happened in my life and in our lives.

22
00:52:29.170 --> 00:52:31.170
Last May.

23
00:52:32.170 --> 00:52:36.170
I have been a heavy alcoholic for 25 years.

24
00:52:36.170 --> 00:52:39.170
My dad was an alcoholic and my grandpa was too.

25
00:52:39.170 --> 00:52:44.170
Over the years, I have tried countless times to stop.

26
00:52:44.170 --> 00:52:48.170
Sometimes I succeeded for a week or two, and then I always relapsed.

27
00:52:49.170 --> 00:52:57.170
Ten years ago, it came into my life through Hadassah and my dear in-laws.

28
00:52:57.170 --> 00:53:02.170
But all those years, I really wanted nothing to do with it.

29
00:53:02.170 --> 00:53:09.170
Especially when I had been drinking, I would become angry, cynical, and rebellious.

30
00:53:11.170 --> 00:53:17.170
With Corona, we got to know Open Church, with the livestreams.

31
00:53:18.170 --> 00:53:22.170
At home, that was easy, on the couch.

32
00:53:24.170 --> 00:53:28.170
But after Corona, we had to come here effectively.

33
00:53:30.170 --> 00:53:32.170
That has been such a struggle.

34
00:53:33.170 --> 00:53:35.170
Months and a bit.

35
00:53:37.170 --> 00:53:39.170
I knew I would go along.

36
00:53:39.170 --> 00:53:44.170
But then I would get up in the morning and not say a word to Hadassah.

37
00:53:44.170 --> 00:53:47.170
40 minutes drive from Hasselt to Lommel.

38
00:53:47.170 --> 00:53:49.170
I looked outside.

39
00:53:49.170 --> 00:53:51.170
Hadassah said that afterwards.

40
00:53:52.170 --> 00:53:54.170
I was mumbling and really rebellious.

41
00:53:54.170 --> 00:53:56.170
That was something that held me back.

42
00:53:57.170 --> 00:54:00.170
But when I was here, it was always good.

43
00:54:00.170 --> 00:54:02.170
Then I felt that it was good.

44
00:54:03.170 --> 00:54:05.170
I just kept coming.

45
00:54:06.170 --> 00:54:08.170
It got better and better.

46
00:54:08.170 --> 00:54:13.170
I also came forward a few times to pray for healing.

47
00:54:15.170 --> 00:54:20.170
Hadassah went to Cyprus for two months in May.

48
00:54:20.170 --> 00:54:22.170
To Gateways Beyond Cyprus.

49
00:54:22.170 --> 00:54:28.170
Through Skype, she talked about the Isaiah 62 fasting.

50
00:54:28.170 --> 00:54:31.170
Three weeks of fasting and praying for Israel.

51
00:54:31.170 --> 00:54:32.170
The 7th of May.

52
00:54:32.170 --> 00:54:38.170
I thought okay, then I will try again to stop drinking.

53
00:54:38.170 --> 00:54:40.170
But I thought it wouldn't work.

54
00:54:41.170 --> 00:54:45.170
The night before, I drank myself completely drunk.

55
00:54:49.170 --> 00:54:51.170
I got up.

56
00:54:56.170 --> 00:54:58.170
I got up, Sunday.

57
00:54:58.170 --> 00:55:01.170
I felt my stomach.

58
00:55:01.170 --> 00:55:03.170
What is that?

59
00:55:03.170 --> 00:55:05.170
I am healed.

60
00:55:05.170 --> 00:55:07.170
I have been set free.

61
00:55:11.170 --> 00:55:15.170
I have been so patient.

62
00:55:15.170 --> 00:55:17.170
Really incredible.

63
00:55:17.170 --> 00:55:20.170
It is like we sometimes sing here.

64
00:55:20.170 --> 00:55:22.170
Do you not feel or see yourself?

65
00:55:22.170 --> 00:55:24.170
He is working.

66
00:55:24.170 --> 00:55:26.170
That is really incredible.

67
00:55:26.170 --> 00:55:30.170
Then I also went to Cyprus for ten days.

68
00:55:30.170 --> 00:55:33.170
Then I also told that.

69
00:55:34.170 --> 00:55:40.170
The leader said I should seal that with baptism.

70
00:55:40.170 --> 00:55:42.170
Then we got baptized.

71
00:55:42.170 --> 00:55:44.170
Then I was born again.

72
00:55:44.170 --> 00:55:45.170
Yes.

73
00:55:57.170 --> 00:55:58.170
Okay.

74
00:56:00.170 --> 00:56:03.170
So we are going to go back to Cyprus.

75
00:56:03.170 --> 00:56:05.170
Last year...

76
00:56:05.170 --> 00:56:07.170
I had known God for longer.

77
00:56:07.170 --> 00:56:10.170
I grew up in a Christian family.

78
00:56:10.170 --> 00:56:15.170
I honor my parents for what they have contributed to my life.

79
00:56:15.170 --> 00:56:17.170
Thank you, mom and dad.

80
00:56:17.170 --> 00:56:19.170
In the back of Cyprus.

81
00:56:21.170 --> 00:56:23.170
My parents are amazing.

82
00:56:23.170 --> 00:56:26.170
For the prayer they have prayed over our lives.

83
00:56:26.170 --> 00:56:27.170
Thank you.

84
00:56:27.170 --> 00:56:28.170
Thank you.

85
00:56:28.170 --> 00:56:30.170
You are fantastic parents.

86
00:56:30.170 --> 00:56:32.170
You have...

87
00:56:32.170 --> 00:56:33.170
Yes.

88
00:56:33.170 --> 00:56:35.170
They never give up.

89
00:56:35.170 --> 00:56:40.170
They have fought so much for us in prayer.

90
00:56:40.170 --> 00:56:42.170
Especially for their children.

91
00:56:42.170 --> 00:56:47.170
I honor them for the upbringing we have had.

92
00:56:47.170 --> 00:56:50.170
We have received so many fantastic things.

93
00:56:50.170 --> 00:56:52.170
We have had education.

94
00:56:52.170 --> 00:56:55.170
We have learned kingdom principles.

95
00:56:55.170 --> 00:56:58.170
I carry those with me today.

96
00:56:58.170 --> 00:57:00.170
I thank them for that.

97
00:57:00.170 --> 00:57:03.170
I had a point in my life.

98
00:57:04.170 --> 00:57:09.170
At thirteen, I already knew very clearly that I wanted to live for God.

99
00:57:09.170 --> 00:57:11.170
I was baptized then.

100
00:57:11.170 --> 00:57:13.170
I felt so strongly.

101
00:57:13.170 --> 00:57:15.170
At one point, I heard a sermon.

102
00:57:15.170 --> 00:57:17.170
A very old sermon.

103
00:57:17.170 --> 00:57:19.170
I don't remember the rest of the sermon.

104
00:57:19.170 --> 00:57:21.170
But there was one sentence.

105
00:57:21.170 --> 00:57:24.170
Don't be satisfied with anything less than God.

106
00:57:24.170 --> 00:57:28.170
That sentence was then branded in my heart.

107
00:57:28.170 --> 00:57:33.170
I also pray for the young people that this desire may burn in your heart.

108
00:57:33.170 --> 00:57:37.170
Later in my life, I made wrong choices.

109
00:57:37.170 --> 00:57:39.170
I entered into a wrong relationship.

110
00:57:39.170 --> 00:57:41.170
I did wrong things.

111
00:57:41.170 --> 00:57:44.170
I also entered into my marriage wrongly.

112
00:57:44.170 --> 00:57:47.170
I did not step onto a straight path with God in that.

113
00:57:47.170 --> 00:57:49.170
Yet God was gracious.

114
00:57:49.170 --> 00:57:53.170
All those years, He kept drawing in my heart.

115
00:57:53.170 --> 00:57:56.170
I just felt that I was torn inside.

116
00:57:56.170 --> 00:57:58.170
I could not live without Him.

117
00:57:58.170 --> 00:58:01.170
That desire was so deeply rooted in my heart.

118
00:58:01.170 --> 00:58:03.170
Until I came to a point.

119
00:58:03.170 --> 00:58:06.170
Actually, right at the beginning of corona.

120
00:58:06.170 --> 00:58:10.170
Where I burst into tears and cried out.

121
00:58:10.170 --> 00:58:12.170
Forgive me, forgive me.

122
00:58:12.170 --> 00:58:15.170
I have taken so much offense at You that it was not right.

123
00:58:15.170 --> 00:58:19.170
That is what we do when we stray far from God.

124
00:58:19.170 --> 00:58:21.170
When we walk our own way.

125
00:58:21.170 --> 00:58:23.170
Then we take offense at God.

126
00:58:24.170 --> 00:58:27.170
Then we think that He is not fair towards us.

127
00:58:27.170 --> 00:58:29.170
Look at what is happening in my life.

128
00:58:29.170 --> 00:58:30.170
This and that.

129
00:58:30.170 --> 00:58:33.170
God brought me completely back to repentance.

130
00:58:33.170 --> 00:58:35.170
I really had to go on my knees and say.

131
00:58:35.170 --> 00:58:37.170
Lord, I have been wrong.

132
00:58:37.170 --> 00:58:38.170
I have been wrong.

133
00:58:38.170 --> 00:58:40.170
I have wronged my husband.

134
00:58:40.170 --> 00:58:42.170
To step wrong in a marriage.

135
00:58:42.170 --> 00:58:45.170
I did not enter purely into my marriage.

136
00:58:45.170 --> 00:58:47.170
God is so gracious.

137
00:58:47.170 --> 00:58:49.170
God is so gracious.

138
00:58:49.170 --> 00:58:51.170
He has brought us back to righteousness.

139
00:58:51.170 --> 00:58:53.170
It has been difficult years.

140
00:58:53.170 --> 00:58:56.170
It has been years of struggle.

141
00:58:56.170 --> 00:58:58.170
Of many tears.

142
00:58:58.170 --> 00:59:00.170
Patrick spoke about his alcohol addiction.

143
00:59:00.170 --> 00:59:03.170
It has been many depths and loneliness.

144
00:59:03.170 --> 00:59:06.170
But in those years, God has been so gracious.

145
00:59:06.170 --> 00:59:08.170
To use that for good.

146
00:59:08.170 --> 00:59:12.170
Where He has made me strong.

147
00:59:12.170 --> 00:59:15.170
And built a foundation.

148
00:59:15.170 --> 00:59:17.170
Even in difficult times.

149
00:59:17.170 --> 00:59:20.170
We have also had times of miscarriages.

150
00:59:20.170 --> 00:59:22.170
We have experienced pain.

151
00:59:22.170 --> 00:59:24.170
We have experienced sorrow.

152
00:59:24.170 --> 00:59:27.170
Despite all that misery, God is great.

153
00:59:27.170 --> 00:59:31.170
When we look to Him.

154
00:59:31.170 --> 00:59:33.170
He lifts us up above.

155
00:59:33.170 --> 00:59:35.170
Every circumstance.

156
00:59:35.170 --> 00:59:37.170
That is so beautiful.

157
00:59:37.170 --> 00:59:39.170
Then we are no longer concerned.

158
00:59:39.170 --> 00:59:40.170
Why?

159
00:59:40.170 --> 00:59:42.170
You are above all.

160
00:59:42.170 --> 00:59:43.170
You are powerful.

161
00:59:43.170 --> 00:59:44.170
You are great.

162
00:59:44.170 --> 00:59:47.170
Your name is worthy to be praised.

163
00:59:47.170 --> 00:59:50.170
Last year in September I felt very strongly.

164
00:59:50.170 --> 00:59:52.170
I felt that God kept saying.

165
00:59:52.170 --> 00:59:53.170
Go, go, go.

166
00:59:53.170 --> 00:59:54.170
Do not wait for Patrick.

167
00:59:54.170 --> 00:59:55.170
Go.

168
00:59:55.170 --> 00:59:57.170
And then He will do the work.

169
00:59:57.170 --> 00:59:58.170
Also in Him.

170
00:59:58.170 --> 01:00:00.170
And ultimately.

171
01:00:00.170 --> 01:00:02.170
Last year I knew that I had to go.

172
01:00:02.170 --> 01:00:03.170
I thought.

173
01:00:03.170 --> 01:00:04.170
Where should I go?

174
01:00:04.170 --> 01:00:05.170
What should I do?

175
01:00:05.170 --> 01:00:07.170
And ultimately Cyprus came so strongly to my mind.

176
01:00:07.170 --> 01:00:10.170
There is a group of Messianic Jews and Christians.

177
01:00:10.170 --> 01:00:13.170
Gateways beyond Cyprus.

178
01:00:13.170 --> 01:00:16.170
They are called in the Middle East.

179
01:00:16.170 --> 01:00:21.170
It is very central in that whole area to be a blessing for Israel.

180
01:00:21.170 --> 01:00:23.170
For all the surrounding countries.

181
01:00:23.170 --> 01:00:26.170
They live in a community.

182
01:00:26.170 --> 01:00:29.170
It is more than just an organization.

183
01:00:29.170 --> 01:00:31.170
They have a very large piece of land.

184
01:00:31.170 --> 01:00:32.170
They have olive trees.

185
01:00:32.170 --> 01:00:33.170
They have a vineyard.

186
01:00:33.170 --> 01:00:35.170
They live off their garden.

187
01:00:35.170 --> 01:00:36.170
Their land.

188
01:00:36.170 --> 01:00:37.170
So they say.

189
01:00:37.170 --> 01:00:39.170
God has given us the land.

190
01:00:39.170 --> 01:00:41.170
We must have stewardship over the land.

191
01:00:41.170 --> 01:00:42.170
Over the people.

192
01:00:43.170 --> 01:00:46.170
They truly live for discipleship.

193
01:00:46.170 --> 01:00:49.170
They had a period when you could also come.

194
01:00:49.170 --> 01:00:52.170
I did that last year in the spring.

195
01:00:52.170 --> 01:00:54.170
To go there for a time.

196
01:00:54.170 --> 01:00:55.170
To say.

197
01:00:55.170 --> 01:00:57.170
I want to give myself completely to you.

198
01:00:57.170 --> 01:00:59.170
It really came to a point where I thought.

199
01:00:59.170 --> 01:01:00.170
Are we going to separate?

200
01:01:00.170 --> 01:01:01.170
Is it going to be okay?

201
01:01:01.170 --> 01:01:03.170
But I received his blessing to go.

202
01:01:03.170 --> 01:01:05.170
That was also a condition that I would go.

203
01:01:05.170 --> 01:01:06.170
I said.

204
01:01:06.170 --> 01:01:07.170
Okay.

205
01:01:07.170 --> 01:01:08.170
He is my covering.

206
01:01:08.170 --> 01:01:09.170
He is my man.

207
01:01:09.170 --> 01:01:12.170
I need him to give his blessing in this.

208
01:01:12.170 --> 01:01:14.170
God has led me so wonderfully.

209
01:01:14.170 --> 01:01:15.170
He said.

210
01:01:15.170 --> 01:01:16.170
Go.

211
01:01:16.170 --> 01:01:17.170
You must go.

212
01:01:17.170 --> 01:01:19.170
If God says you must go.

213
01:01:19.170 --> 01:01:20.170
I thought.

214
01:01:20.170 --> 01:01:21.170
How is he going to do that?

215
01:01:21.170 --> 01:01:22.170
I am in Cyprus.

216
01:01:22.170 --> 01:01:23.170
He is there.

217
01:01:23.170 --> 01:01:25.170
Will everything be alright?

218
01:01:25.170 --> 01:01:26.170
God said.

219
01:01:26.170 --> 01:01:27.170
Let it go.

220
01:01:27.170 --> 01:01:28.170
I am working in his heart.

221
01:01:28.170 --> 01:01:29.170
It is so pledged.

222
01:01:29.170 --> 01:01:30.170
That first day.

223
01:01:30.170 --> 01:01:33.170
I was on my knees praying for Israel that night.

224
01:01:33.170 --> 01:01:35.170
From May 6 to 7.

225
01:01:36.170 --> 01:01:39.170
And that morning he rose and said.

226
01:01:39.170 --> 01:01:41.170
I am a new person.

227
01:01:41.170 --> 01:01:43.170
God picked me up and I have changed.

228
01:01:43.170 --> 01:01:45.170
And in that, it is so special.

229
01:01:45.170 --> 01:01:47.170
That is also a testimony of.

230
01:01:47.170 --> 01:01:50.170
He calls us to bless his people.

231
01:01:50.170 --> 01:01:52.170
To be a blessing to Israel.

232
01:01:52.170 --> 01:01:54.170
And then he will also work it in us.

233
01:01:54.170 --> 01:01:56.170
That is not the reason why we do it.

234
01:01:56.170 --> 01:01:58.170
But he does work it out in our lives.

235
01:01:58.170 --> 01:02:01.170
And we have seen that in the last months.

236
01:02:01.170 --> 01:02:03.170
God is preparing our hearts.

237
01:02:04.170 --> 01:02:05.170
Israel.

238
01:02:05.170 --> 01:02:07.170
In particular, I think.

239
01:02:07.170 --> 01:02:10.170
We have received so many words about that.

240
01:02:11.170 --> 01:02:12.170
However we go.

241
01:02:12.170 --> 01:02:14.170
There is a trip planned in the spring.

242
01:02:14.170 --> 01:02:16.170
To go to Israel.

243
01:02:16.170 --> 01:02:18.170
We will definitely be there in Cyprus.

244
01:02:19.170 --> 01:02:22.170
Actually, the sermon he gave about the door.

245
01:02:22.170 --> 01:02:25.170
That morning we sat and felt so strong.

246
01:02:25.170 --> 01:02:27.170
He calls us to go.

247
01:02:27.170 --> 01:02:29.170
And to go through that gate.

248
01:02:29.170 --> 01:02:31.170
To enter in.

249
01:02:31.170 --> 01:02:34.170
And to step into the work where he calls us.

250
01:02:34.170 --> 01:02:37.170
I think that is a time of forewarning.

251
01:02:37.170 --> 01:02:39.170
We are going to do a lot of outreach.

252
01:02:39.170 --> 01:02:40.170
Nursing homes.

253
01:02:40.170 --> 01:02:41.170
Sharing.

254
01:02:41.170 --> 01:02:43.170
Give to the poor.

255
01:02:43.170 --> 01:02:48.170
They also live very much from Matthew 24.

256
01:02:48.170 --> 01:02:49.170
Where God says.

257
01:02:49.170 --> 01:02:51.170
What you have done for the least of these.

258
01:02:51.170 --> 01:02:53.170
You have done for me.

259
01:02:53.170 --> 01:02:56.170
We also experienced that when you were there too.

260
01:02:56.170 --> 01:02:58.170
We experience that God is now giving us that place.

261
01:02:58.170 --> 01:03:00.170
For the coming time gives.

262
01:03:00.170 --> 01:03:01.170
To grow there.

263
01:03:01.170 --> 01:03:03.170
To be discipled.

264
01:03:03.170 --> 01:03:04.170
To be taken along.

265
01:03:04.170 --> 01:03:07.170
And to stand and walk.

266
01:03:07.170 --> 01:03:09.170
In the principles of God.

267
01:03:31.170 --> 01:03:33.170
Lord, we thank You for the way.

268
01:03:35.170 --> 01:03:36.170
That You make a way.

269
01:03:38.170 --> 01:03:39.170
In every respect.

270
01:03:41.170 --> 01:03:43.170
Thank You for this open door.

271
01:03:45.170 --> 01:03:47.170
In the life of Hadassah and Patrick.

272
01:03:49.170 --> 01:03:51.170
Thank You that they have a heart for the mission.

273
01:03:51.170 --> 01:04:06.170
And I remember that the Lord said that this church will be a place where we prepare and send people into missionary work.

274
01:04:06.170 --> 01:04:16.170
A starting point of glory where we set people free in missionary work.

275
01:04:17.170 --> 01:04:21.170
And therefore we bless them this morning as well.

276
01:04:23.170 --> 01:04:25.170
We pray for provision for them.

277
01:04:27.170 --> 01:04:29.170
That You bring provision for them.

278
01:04:31.170 --> 01:04:33.170
