02:00:04.170 --> 02:00:07.170
What is the relationship between righteousness and lawlessness?

946
02:00:07.170 --> 02:00:09.170
So a Christian and a non-Christian.

947
02:00:09.170 --> 02:00:12.170
What does light have to do with darkness?

948
02:00:12.170 --> 02:00:13.170
Okay.

949
02:00:13.170 --> 02:00:14.170
Okay.

950
02:00:14.170 --> 02:00:20.170
I know there are people in the room who are in a relationship or even a marriage

951
02:00:20.170 --> 02:00:27.170
and who started believing in Jesus and then still enter into a relationship with someone who does not believe in Jesus.

952
02:00:27.170 --> 02:00:29.170
And God can work this out for good.

953
02:00:29.170 --> 02:00:31.170
God can bring this to a good outcome.

954
02:00:31.170 --> 02:00:34.170
And God bless you and that's really nice.

955
02:00:34.170 --> 02:00:38.170
Patrick and Hadassah just testified about this on stage.

956
02:00:38.170 --> 02:00:41.170
One believes in God, the other does not believe in God.

957
02:00:41.170 --> 02:00:43.170
And then you try it.

958
02:00:43.170 --> 02:00:46.170
And there are several here in the church for whom that has gone well.

959
02:00:46.170 --> 02:00:49.170
But it can also go terribly wrong.

960
02:00:49.170 --> 02:00:50.170
Do not try that.

961
02:00:50.170 --> 02:00:55.170
Jesus who says, do not test the Lord your God.

962
02:00:55.170 --> 02:01:01.170
For Satan says to Jesus on a high building, jump down says Satan to Jesus.

963
02:01:01.170 --> 02:01:04.170
And then you can look at me for God will catch you.

964
02:01:04.170 --> 02:01:08.170
For the angels will catch you so that you will not strike your foot against a stone.

965
02:01:08.170 --> 02:01:12.170
So Satan challenges Jesus, go ahead, test the Lord your God.

966
02:01:12.170 --> 02:01:14.170
And then Jesus says, you must not do this.

967
02:01:14.170 --> 02:01:16.170
You may not test God.

968
02:01:16.170 --> 02:01:22.170
So do not act foolishly in a relationship, saying God will save me.

969
02:01:22.170 --> 02:01:24.170
For what if He does not?

970
02:01:24.170 --> 02:01:26.170
You will be left with a mess.

971
02:01:26.170 --> 02:01:30.170
If God does not save you, for He is not responsible for saving you.

972
02:01:30.170 --> 02:01:33.170
He is your Lord, you are not His Lord.

973
02:01:33.170 --> 02:01:38.170
So you cannot start a reckless relationship and then say, well now you must fix this God, for you are so loving too.

974
02:01:38.170 --> 02:01:40.170
That is arrogant towards God.

975
02:01:40.170 --> 02:01:42.170
God has no responsibility towards us.

976
02:01:42.170 --> 02:01:45.170
Start a relationship His way.

977
02:01:45.170 --> 02:01:51.170
And always start a relationship by looking at whether that person is in Christ.

978
02:01:51.170 --> 02:01:53.170
Just looking here at those words.

979
02:01:53.170 --> 02:01:56.170
Do not walk in the same and the same.

980
02:01:56.170 --> 02:01:58.170
I find it strange to see that there.

981
02:01:58.170 --> 02:02:00.170
Yes, I know that, but still I find it strange.

982
02:02:00.170 --> 02:02:03.170
Doesn't run in one and the same span.

983
02:02:03.170 --> 02:02:04.170
I know.

984
02:02:04.170 --> 02:02:06.170
But still I find it strange.

985
02:02:06.170 --> 02:02:08.170
Doesn't run in one and the same.

986
02:02:08.170 --> 02:02:09.170
I just find it strange.

987
02:02:09.170 --> 02:02:11.170
You just have to read English.

988
02:02:12.170 --> 02:02:15.170
This is a wrong span.

989
02:02:15.170 --> 02:02:19.170
You have two horses, they get a yoke, they get a span.

990
02:02:19.170 --> 02:02:21.170
And those two horses will pull.

991
02:02:21.170 --> 02:02:30.170
They have already proven in that horse sport that two horses standing next to each other are not twice as strong as one horse.

992
02:02:30.170 --> 02:02:33.170
They are many times stronger than one horse.

993
02:02:33.170 --> 02:02:39.170
So not one horse is power 5, two horses is power 10.

994
02:02:39.170 --> 02:02:40.170
No.

995
02:02:40.170 --> 02:02:43.170
I don't know what the number is, but two horses...

996
02:02:43.170 --> 02:02:44.170
Sorry?

997
02:02:44.170 --> 02:02:46.170
One hp, one horsepower.

998
02:02:46.170 --> 02:02:47.170
Yeah right.

999
02:02:47.170 --> 02:02:49.170
I know, I know.

1000
02:02:49.170 --> 02:02:52.170
But one horse is stronger than one horsepower.

1001
02:02:52.170 --> 02:02:53.170
That is really true.

1002
02:02:53.170 --> 02:02:54.170
That is indeed true.

1003
02:02:54.170 --> 02:03:02.170
But well, if you say, dear sister, if you say that one horse is one horsepower, two horses are not two horsepower.

1004
02:03:02.170 --> 02:03:04.170
Two horses are many horsepower.

1005
02:03:04.170 --> 02:03:06.170
And that is the beauty.

1006
02:03:07.170 --> 02:03:09.170
Come on, get this guys.

1007
02:03:09.170 --> 02:03:12.170
That is the beauty of a Christian marriage.

1008
02:03:12.170 --> 02:03:16.170
Together you will defeat many tens of thousands.

1009
02:03:16.170 --> 02:03:19.170
Together you have so much strength in Christ.

1010
02:03:19.170 --> 02:03:22.170
Don't do that relationship alone.

1011
02:03:22.170 --> 02:03:24.170
Because in the end, you will get tired.

1012
02:03:24.170 --> 02:03:31.170
Ultimately, if you, girl, are the only one who is in Christ, and you bring along that tough guy who is not in Christ.

1013
02:03:31.170 --> 02:03:32.170
And who is so tough.

1014
02:03:32.170 --> 02:03:34.170
Because oh, he has such gangster behavior.

1015
02:03:34.170 --> 02:03:35.170
Ah, I find that so nice.

1016
02:03:35.170 --> 02:03:37.170
And I fall for the bad guy.

1017
02:03:37.170 --> 02:03:38.170
In the end, you will get tired.

1018
02:03:38.170 --> 02:03:41.170
Because ultimately you have to pull that whole relationship forward by yourself.

1019
02:03:41.170 --> 02:03:42.170
And it just doesn't work.

1020
02:03:42.170 --> 02:03:43.170
You get tired of it.

1021
02:03:43.170 --> 02:03:45.170
And ultimately, it falls apart.

1022
02:03:45.170 --> 02:03:46.170
Why?

1023
02:03:46.170 --> 02:03:48.170
Do not walk in the same yoke.

1024
02:03:48.170 --> 02:03:50.170
For ultimately, this does not work.

1025
02:03:50.170 --> 02:03:52.170
And it is the same in a marriage.

1026
02:03:52.170 --> 02:03:55.170
Vanessa and I are two separate individuals.

1027
02:03:55.170 --> 02:03:59.170
So we are both individually responsible for our own relationship in Christ.

1028
02:03:59.170 --> 02:04:01.170
Once I had a good time.

1029
02:04:01.170 --> 02:04:03.170
Once I had a difficult period.

1030
02:04:03.170 --> 02:04:07.170
It is not the case that Vanessa and I always go at the same pace.

1031
02:04:07.170 --> 02:04:12.170
There is a period when I will lead and I can pull her along in faith.

1032
02:04:12.170 --> 02:04:16.170
And there will be a period, and there are long periods, when she goes ahead of me.

1033
02:04:16.170 --> 02:04:19.170
But at the very least, that is how it goes.

1034
02:04:19.170 --> 02:04:20.170
Right?

1035
02:04:20.170 --> 02:04:21.170
And that is good, namely.

1036
02:04:21.170 --> 02:04:25.170
For if it is always one-sided, then it is exhausting and it destroys everything.

1037
02:04:25.170 --> 02:04:26.170
Do not do it.

1038
02:04:26.170 --> 02:04:27.170
Do not do it.

1039
02:04:27.170 --> 02:04:29.170
And that is why there is a rule that Paul says.

1040
02:04:29.170 --> 02:04:32.170
Do not walk in the same yoke.

1041
02:04:32.170 --> 02:04:35.170
Make sure you are together in Christ Jesus.

1042
02:04:35.170 --> 02:04:37.170
Shall we stand? I am going to close this service.

1043
02:04:40.170 --> 02:04:41.170
Yes, half past twelve.

1044
02:04:42.170 --> 02:04:43.170
Alright, here we go.

1045
02:04:45.170 --> 02:04:47.170
So the big question, why date?

1046
02:04:47.170 --> 02:04:51.170
You date to eventually marry someone.

1047
02:04:51.170 --> 02:04:52.170
That is the big question.

1048
02:04:52.170 --> 02:04:55.170
Do I ultimately want to marry this person?

1049
02:04:55.170 --> 02:05:01.170
And can I take authority over the life that God has given us here on earth with this person?

1050
02:05:01.170 --> 02:05:03.170
That is the big why question about dating.

1051
02:05:03.170 --> 02:05:08.170
And the big how question is, approach it God's way.

1052
02:05:08.170 --> 02:05:13.170
Approach it in a divine manner that is fitting for God.

1053
02:05:13.170 --> 02:05:16.170
In a way that can please God.

1054
02:05:16.170 --> 02:05:19.170
I want to make one last call to the whole church.

1055
02:05:19.170 --> 02:05:20.170
Listen.

1056
02:05:20.170 --> 02:05:25.170
It is important that not only the pastor should approach people.

1057
02:05:25.170 --> 02:05:29.170
And say, listen, shall we do it this way and shall we do it that way?

1058
02:05:29.170 --> 02:05:33.170
The church of Jesus Christ is given to one another.

1059
02:05:33.170 --> 02:05:35.170
To be able to help each other.

1060
02:05:35.170 --> 02:05:40.170
People please, do not be indifferent towards one another and think, Tim will sort it out.

1061
02:05:40.170 --> 02:05:45.170
Because then I find it very difficult with a whole lot of conversations I need to have with people or Sjaan.

1062
02:05:45.170 --> 02:05:49.170
But let us together be one body of Christ.

1063
02:05:49.170 --> 02:05:54.170
Parents, talk to your children about the relationship they want to enter into at that moment.

1064
02:05:54.170 --> 02:05:57.170
Friends, I want to look at you, all young people.

1065
02:05:57.170 --> 02:05:59.170
I am looking at you.

1066
02:05:59.170 --> 02:06:02.170
Be in conversation with each other and dare to.

1067
02:06:02.170 --> 02:06:04.170
Dare to speak to one another.

1068
02:06:04.170 --> 02:06:06.170
If you love each other anyway.

1069
02:06:06.170 --> 02:06:08.170
If you are friends with each other anyway.

1070
02:06:08.170 --> 02:06:10.170
If you are brothers and sisters in Christ anyway.

1071
02:06:10.170 --> 02:06:14.170
Then go once, while you are building a cozy fire together.

1072
02:06:14.170 --> 02:06:18.170
Then have a conversation and say to your buddy or to your girlfriend.

1073
02:06:18.170 --> 02:06:22.170
Just say, hey listen, can we talk for a moment about that relationship you are involved in.

1074
02:06:22.170 --> 02:06:23.170
That is not in Christ.

1075
02:06:23.170 --> 02:06:27.170
And then, listen, yes, people will get offended by that.

1076
02:06:27.170 --> 02:06:29.170
Those are not easy conversations.

1077
02:06:29.170 --> 02:06:34.170
But I want in the church that we do not shy away from these uncomfortable conversations.

1078
02:06:34.170 --> 02:06:37.170
Not because we can then become a rejecting church towards each other.

1079
02:06:37.170 --> 02:06:39.170
And that we can argue with each other.

1080
02:06:39.170 --> 02:06:41.170
But build each other up.

1081
02:06:41.170 --> 02:06:46.170
Build each other up and just say, hey listen about that relationship or about that guy you like so much.

1082
02:06:46.170 --> 02:06:49.170
Listen, if I were you, take it easy.

1083
02:06:49.170 --> 02:06:51.170
Just take a look at it for a while longer.

1084
02:06:51.170 --> 02:06:56.170
Or, hey listen, you were talking recently about this and that and you want to move in together in a rental property.

1085
02:06:56.170 --> 02:06:57.170
Don't do that just yet.

1086
02:06:57.170 --> 02:06:59.170
First, get married to each other.

1087
02:06:59.170 --> 02:07:01.170
Make things right first with God and yourself.

1088
02:07:01.170 --> 02:07:03.170
Stop having sex with each other.

1089
02:07:03.170 --> 02:07:06.170
And do it God's way, the way that pleases God.

1090
02:07:06.170 --> 02:07:08.170
And then you can help each other as a church.

1091
02:07:08.170 --> 02:07:09.170
Do you understand what I mean?

1092
02:07:09.170 --> 02:07:12.170
I am really making a call to the church here.

1093
02:07:12.170 --> 02:07:15.170
Because otherwise, Vanessa and I and Sjaan will have a really hard time.

1094
02:07:15.170 --> 02:07:18.170
Every time again, that we have to start those conversations.

1095
02:07:18.170 --> 02:07:22.170
While parents have a responsibility and the church has a responsibility to each other.

1096
02:07:22.170 --> 02:07:24.170
Is that a good idea?

1097
02:07:24.170 --> 02:07:25.170
Alright, cool.

1098
02:07:25.170 --> 02:07:28.170
Can we close our eyes and then I will close the service.

1099
02:07:28.170 --> 02:07:32.170
Dear King Jesus, I thank you that we can have this month together.

1100
02:07:32.170 --> 02:07:35.170
Lord, these are conversations that are not always easy.

1101
02:07:35.170 --> 02:07:37.170
But I know that you are good.

1102
02:07:37.170 --> 02:07:39.170
I know that your Word is the truth.

1103
02:07:39.170 --> 02:07:43.170
And I also know that everyone who is listening at this moment.

1104
02:07:43.170 --> 02:07:46.170
And thinks to themselves, I need restoration in my relationship.

1105
02:07:46.170 --> 02:07:48.170
I need restoration in my relationship.

1106
02:07:48.170 --> 02:07:52.170
I know, Jesus, that you are the Savior of humanity.

1107
02:07:52.170 --> 02:07:54.170
I know that you restore things.

1108
02:07:54.170 --> 02:07:56.170
I know that you are good, Lord.

1109
02:07:56.170 --> 02:08:03.170
And I want to pray in the name of Jesus, that we will place our trust in you.

1110
02:08:04.170 --> 02:08:06.170
While all eyes are closed.

1111
02:08:06.170 --> 02:08:09.170
Please, please, everyone close your eyes for a moment.

1112
02:08:09.170 --> 02:08:12.170
I want to speak to your soul and I want to say.

1113
02:08:12.170 --> 02:08:16.170
Friend, sister, brother, if you are here in the room.

1114
02:08:18.170 --> 02:08:20.170
I want to appeal to your faith.

1115
02:08:20.170 --> 02:08:22.170
And I want to call you to Christ.

1116
02:08:22.170 --> 02:08:24.170
Come to Christ.

1117
02:08:24.170 --> 02:08:26.170
Even in your relationship.

1118
02:08:26.170 --> 02:08:28.170
Come to Christ.

1119
02:08:28.170 --> 02:08:31.170
Lay your life down before him.

1120
02:08:32.170 --> 02:08:36.170
Christian, pray with me in your soul.

1121
02:08:36.170 --> 02:08:39.170
Speak in tongues, for these are important prayers.

1122
02:08:39.170 --> 02:08:43.170
I don't want to just rush through this and then conclude the service.

1123
02:08:43.170 --> 02:08:46.170
Lay your life down before Him.

1124
02:08:46.170 --> 02:08:49.170
Maybe you're feeling terrified right now.

1125
02:08:49.170 --> 02:08:51.170
Maybe you're feeling scared right now.

1126
02:08:51.170 --> 02:08:54.170
Yes, but Tim, I'm already in a relationship. How am I supposed to do that, huh?

1127
02:08:54.170 --> 02:08:57.170
Lay your life down before Jesus.

1128
02:08:57.170 --> 02:09:00.170
He will set it right.

1129
02:09:00.170 --> 02:09:03.170
He can set your relationship right.

1130
02:09:03.170 --> 02:09:05.170
That it stays together.

1131
02:09:05.170 --> 02:09:12.170
He can also help you to put an end to a relationship that will never work out.

1132
02:09:12.170 --> 02:09:15.170
Lay your life down before Jesus.

1133
02:09:15.170 --> 02:09:18.170
Really. Come to repentance.

1134
02:09:18.170 --> 02:09:20.170
Come to Jesus.

1135
02:09:20.170 --> 02:09:26.170
Simply say, Lord, I'm sorry for how I, like the world, view relationships.

1136
02:09:26.170 --> 02:09:29.170
Lord, I want to live as You want.

1137
02:09:29.170 --> 02:09:31.170
And I want You to make me happy.

1138
02:09:31.170 --> 02:09:34.170
This is a clear question that you may lay before God.

1139
02:09:34.170 --> 02:09:36.170
Make me happy, Lord.

1140
02:09:36.170 --> 02:09:38.170
I want to be happy.

1141
02:09:38.170 --> 02:09:41.170
This is a right that everyone has in this room.

1142
02:09:41.170 --> 02:09:44.170
Everyone has the right to be happy.

1143
02:09:44.170 --> 02:09:46.170
But Jesus Christ is your happiness.

1144
02:09:46.170 --> 02:09:49.170
He is your happiness. He is your savior.

1145
02:09:49.170 --> 02:09:52.170
And he wants to bless you in your relationship.

1146
02:09:52.170 --> 02:09:55.170
And I bless us all in the name of Jesus.

1147
02:09:56.170 --> 02:10:01.170
That this information you heard today about courtship periods leading to marriage.

1148
02:10:01.170 --> 02:10:03.170
That it will help you.

1149
02:10:03.170 --> 02:10:06.170
And that it will set your life on a good path.

1150
02:10:06.170 --> 02:10:10.170
And that you will be happy and blessed.

1151
02:10:10.170 --> 02:10:12.170
In Jesus' name. Amen.

1152
02:10:12.170 --> 02:10:13.170
Amen.

1153
02:10:13.170 --> 02:10:15.170
Thank you all very much.

1154
02:10:16.170 --> 02:10:17.170
Oh yes.

1155
02:10:17.170 --> 02:10:19.170
Thank you all very much.

