02:10:32.170 --> 02:10:34.170
Just walk around the building for a bit.

1162
02:10:34.170 --> 02:10:36.170
Take a quick peek into the kitchen.

1163
02:10:36.170 --> 02:10:38.170
And then be sure to say wow. That's nice.

